name: Two-page lesson review preserves exact selection, context copies and retirement
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/lesson_book.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: lessons
require-live-snap: 30 Book lesson 060 | first-page
resize: 40x12
live-snap: compact-browser-40x12
expect: Space select
expect: [/] pages
ask: Can a keyboard-only operator discover selection, paging and refresh in the compact lesson book before choosing a reviewed lesson?
resize: 60x20
live-snap: compact-browser-60x20
resize: 120x36
keys: ]
require-live-snap: 20 page 2 | second-page
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 Accepted · Book lesson 001 | selected-primary
keys: Space
require-live-snap: 20 1 selected | selected-reference
keys: u Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Book lesson 001 · revision 2 | first-copy-confirmation
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Saved context: | first-copy
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/lesson_book.py @TMP_TARGET @ART first-copy
require-live-snap: 20 Accepted · Book lesson 001 | copy-origin-ready
keys: e End
paste-file: @ART/title-suffix.txt
require-live-snap: 20 Book lesson 001 updated | title-edit
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM LESSON DRAFT | update-confirmation
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 10 outside this page | saved-outside-page
expect: Book lesson 001 updated
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/lesson_book.py @TMP_TARGET @ART updated
resize: 160x48
live-snap: recorded-selection-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: recorded-selection-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: recorded-selection-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: recorded-selection-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: recorded-selection-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: recorded-page-1-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: recorded-page-2-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: recorded-page-3-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: recorded-page-4-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: recorded-page-5-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: recorded-page-6-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: recorded-page-7-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: recorded-page-8-40x12
ask: Does saving the oldest lesson preserve that exact updated revision across page reordering, with an honest off-page receipt and keyboard-reachable origin and review actions at every size?
resize: 120x36
keys: Home R
require-live-snap: 20 outside this page | refreshed-recorded-selection
expect: Book lesson 001 updated
keys: a
paste-file: @ART/accept-reason.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM ACCEPTED LESSON | updated-accept-confirmation
expect: Book lesson 001 updated
resize: 160x48
live-snap: accept-confirmation-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: accept-confirmation-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: accept-confirmation-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: accept-confirmation-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: accept-confirmation-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: accept-page-1-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: accept-page-2-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: accept-page-3-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: accept-page-4-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: accept-page-5-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: accept-page-6-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: accept-page-7-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: accept-page-8-40x12
resize: 120x36
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 Book lesson 001 updated | inspected-accept-confirmation
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 outside this page | accepted-recorded-selection
keys: Space u Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Book lesson 001 updated · revision 4 | second-copy-confirmation
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Saved context: | second-copy
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/lesson_book.py @TMP_TARGET @ART second-copy
require-live-snap: 20 outside this page | second-copy-origin-ready
keys: t
paste-file: @ART/retire-reason.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONFIRM RETIRED LESSON | retire-confirmation
expect: Book lesson 001 updated
resize: 160x48
live-snap: retire-confirmation-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: retire-confirmation-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: retire-confirmation-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: retire-confirmation-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: retire-confirmation-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: retire-page-1-40x12
keys: PageDown
live-snap: retire-page-2-40x12
