live-snap: retire-page-8-40x12
ask: Do acceptance and retirement confirmations identify the exact title, revision, origin and operator reason at all six sizes before the final Enter?
resize: 120x36
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 Book lesson 001 updated | inspected-retire-confirmation
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 outside this page | retired-recorded-selection
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/lesson_book.py @TMP_TARGET @ART retired
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: lessons
require-live-snap: 30 Retired · Book lesson 001 updated | recovered-book
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/lesson_book.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain all sixty lessons, the exact primary retirement and both historical context copies, with future reuse blocked and no model calls or changes to finding truth?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
